Package: fmrigds
Type: Package
Title: Lazy, Format-Agnostic Group Analysis for fMRI
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R: c(
    person("Brad", "Buchsbaum", email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides a Group Data Set (GDS) abstraction and lazy analysis
    pipeline for first-level fMRI statistical outputs. Unifies tabular, NIfTI,
    HDF5, and fmristore inputs under a common sample x subject x contrast
    representation; supports space-aware transformations, group and meta-analytic
    reducers, provenance tracking, and reproducible export.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
